# Layered Feature Architecture + Clan-Core Integration

## How Clan-Core Tags Work with Layers

Clan-core uses an **inventory system** where machines can have **tags**, and service roles can target those tags. This maps beautifully to layered architecture.

**Key clan-core concepts** :
- **Machines**: Individual hosts in your fleet
- **Tags**: Labels applied to machines (e.g., `["server", "backup", "monitoring"]`)
- **Instances**: Service definitions with roles
- **Roles**: Parts of a service (client/server) that target machines or tags

